{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他似乎已经走进一段幸福的亲密关系，却开始担心心意表达得越多，自己就越容易受伤。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、珍惜、犹豫、不安、隐痛\",\n      \"missed\": \"刚握到手里才发现留不住的失落，以及坚定说了是之后又追问可是呢的心理反复；右侧从心动不敢说到不再隐藏喜欢的完整变化过程，需要逐条读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经开始相信彼此需要，却发现幸福并没有消除不安，反而开始担心这份幸福会带来疼痛。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、患得患失、犹豫、悲伤、不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"正文中明亮逐渐掺进尖锐和暗沉的变化，以及幸福没有消失、悲伤却进入幸福的具体转折；右侧八个阶段的先后关系一眼难以读全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他不再隐藏喜欢，似乎终于拥有了幸福，但也开始感受到幸福里面出现了疼痛。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、脆弱、担忧、苦涩、隐隐的悲伤\",\n      \"missed\": \"从不敢表达心意到不再隐藏喜欢的关系发展过程，以及为什么幸福会逐渐混入悲伤的具体心理描写，都需要回头读正文和右侧条目。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主标题非常醒目，核心问题一眼能抓到，但它主要提出了一个疑问，没有直接交代人物此刻的具体处境。真正把人物经历和感受连起来的内容，分散在两行较长的正文和右侧八条小字里。右侧条目虽然构成了从心动、靠近、害怕失去到幸福里生出疼的过程，但条数偏多、字号偏小，三秒内难以读出完整关系。下方金色音符动画有视觉动感，却只是跟随音乐变化，没有进一步呈现人物处境。整体是主题抓得住，情绪也能接上，但人物经历的具体脉络需要补读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cd56a5e1-d92e-4cd0-a59a-fedb5e6d06fb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T005457128359Z", "elapsed_seconds": 65.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:56:02.736402+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bf675d6819700e7beef9382f32b1b3cabece6ddd5518e08f7e02f921f950096c", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T005457128359Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "aedb964217c7866ae0406b3875d44b7370255d4c92fb772595b3764850d365c0"}}}
